AgentMax MCP layer
==================

The modules in this package (protocol.py, transport.py, client.py, and parts
of server.py) are adapted from the OpenJarvis project:

    OpenJarvis — https://github.com/open-jarvis/OpenJarvis
    Copyright the OpenJarvis authors.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

A copy of the Apache License 2.0 is available at:

    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Changes from the original include: renaming to the AgentMax namespace,
modernized type hints, a generic handler-based MCPServer (decoupled from
OpenJarvis tool classes), and the MCPManager registry bridge.
